<title>FRANCE: French June raw steel output up 20.2 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>French June raw steel output up 20.2 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>French raw steel output reached 1.768 million tonnes in June, up 20.2 percent from the same month a year earlier, figures released by the French steel federation showed.</p>
<p>For the first six months of 1997, steel output totalled 9.976 million tonnes, a rise of 14.8 percent over the corresponding period a year earlier.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
